<header class="xm-head">
  <div>
    <h1 class="xm-title">浏览历史</h1>
    <p class="xm-sub">共 {{ total }} 条记录</p>
  </div>
  {% if total %}
    <a class="xm-btn xm-btn--danger" href="{{ urls.history_clear }}">清空历史</a>
  {% endif %}
</header>

{% if not enabled %}
  <div class="xm-notice">
    <strong>浏览历史记录已关闭</strong>
    <span>关闭后不会记录新的浏览行为。已有记录仍会保留，可以在这里删除单条记录或清空全部。</span>
    <a href="{{ urls.settings }}">去开启</a>
  </div>
{% endif %}

<nav class="xm-tabs" aria-label="浏览历史筛选">
  {% for filter in filters %}
    <a href="{{ filter.url }}" class="xm-tab{% if filter.active %} is-active{% endif %}"{% if filter.active %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>{{ filter.label }}</a>
  {% endfor %}
</nav>

{% if items %}
  <div class="xm-grid">
    {% for card in items %}
      {% include '@xedc_member/templates/xedc-member-card.html.twig' with {card: card} %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {{ pager }}
{% else %}
  <div class="xm-empty">
    <strong>{{ empty }}</strong>
    <p>登录后打开美图、视频或文章详情页，浏览记录会自动出现在这里。</p>
    <div class="xm-empty__links">
      <a href="/meitu">看看美图</a>
      <a href="/video">看看视频</a>
      <a href="/articles">看看文章</a>
    </div>
  </div>
{% endif %}
